---
/**
 * Shows a screen at its full layout and scales it down as a whole, so a small preview keeps the exact spacing of the
 * large one: nothing overlaps or clips. The scaling is done in scripts/chrome.ts; on narrow screens, where the
 * screen has its own small layout, it is left alone.
 */
---

<div class="scaled" data-scaled>
  <div class="scaled__inner" data-scaled-inner><slot /></div>
</div>
